<div class="BodyFragment"><font size="2"><span style="font-size:11pt;">
<div class="PlainText">Welcome to the Host-volunteers-urgent-park-needs@omls.oregon.gov<br>
mailing list! Welcome Oregon State Park Host Volunteers!<br>
<br>
Member's of this email list will receive email announcements from<br>
Oregon State Parks in need of volunteers for upcoming volunteer<br>
assignments. Only Approved OPRD staff members have are able to send<br>
out messages to this email list.<br>
<br>
You were added to this email list because on your host volunteer<br>
application, you selected either of the following: &quot;Interest in<br>
Emergency Fill-in Host Assignments&quot; OR &quot;Please Call! Willing to<br>
Consider Other Assignments&quot; <br>
<br>
<br>
<br>
<br>
<br>
<br>
<br>
To post to this list, send your message to:<br>
<br>
&nbsp; host-volunteers-urgent-park-needs@omls.oregon.gov<br>
<br>
General information about the mailing list is at:<br>
<br>
&nbsp; <a href="https://omls.oregon.gov/mailman/listinfo/host-volunteers-urgent-park-needs">
https://omls.oregon.gov/mailman/listinfo/host-volunteers-urgent-park-needs</a><br>
<br>
<br>
If you ever want to unsubscribe or change your options (eg, switch to<br>
or from digest mode, change your password, etc.), visit your<br>
subscription page at:<br>
<br>
&nbsp; <a href="https://omls.oregon.gov/mailman/options/host-volunteers-urgent-park-needs/rsw%40rswfire.com">
https://omls.oregon.gov/mailman/options/host-volunteers-urgent-park-needs/rsw%40rswfire.com</a><br>
<br>
<br>
You can also make such adjustments via email by sending a message to:<br>
<br>
&nbsp; Host-volunteers-urgent-park-needs-request@omls.oregon.gov<br>
<br>
with the word `help' in the subject or body (don't include the<br>
quotes), and you will get back a message with instructions.<br>
<br>
You must know your password to change your options (including changing<br>
the password, itself) or to unsubscribe without confirmation.&nbsp; It is:<br>
<br>
&nbsp; idigvuwu<br>
<br>
Normally, Mailman will remind you of your omls.oregon.gov mailing list<br>
passwords once every month, although you can disable this if you<br>
prefer.&nbsp; This reminder will also include instructions on how to<br>
unsubscribe or change your account options.&nbsp; There is also a button on<br>
your options page that will email your current password to you.<br>
